{"results": [{"id": "hp_doc_465c88ec43a0c611417564b7a09629f3adf64acadf77c445fedb13f89c28b6ce", "title": "Melaka Wonderland", "text": "The Melaka Wonderland is a water theme park and resort in Ayer Keroh, Melaka, Malaysia.", "score": 26.5955}, {"id": "hp_doc_5bc2c38b9b897184b1c44ea07bdcb5ea4ae55b1b0e54f2ecdb55b8ee5a52065a", "title": "Melaka City Council", "text": "Melaka City Council (officially: Historical Melaka City Council) (\"Malay: Majlis Bandaraya Melaka Bersejarah\") (MBMB) is a local authority which administers Melaka City and other areas of Central Melaka District. This agency is under Melaka State Government. MBMB are responsible for public health and sanitation, cleanliness management, town planning, environmental protection and building control, social and economic development and general maintenance functions of urban infrastructure. The MBMB main headquarters is located at Graha Makmur in Ayer Keroh.", "score": 13.4955}, {"id": "hp_doc_76397bd4929257a42eb40077955f1a0a620bf2595276f70a29a71cb9ac8c3a62", "title": "Melaka Gateway Arch", "text": "Melaka Gateway Arch or Ayer Keroh Arch is a landmark arch to Melaka City. It is located on Ayer Keroh Highway (Federal route ) in Ayer Keroh, Melaka, Malaysia. It marks the Central Melaka-Alor Gajah district border. Three towers on both sides of the arch represent the three major races in Malaysia: Malay, Chinese and Indian.", "score": 13.1897}], "remaining_searches": 2}
